      "updated": 1761523200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Backups: one folder for all instances (backupRoot, default C:\\GameWarden\\backups); copying it off the machine is up to you.\nDaily 04:00 (VM time) by default · keep the last 14 scheduled · pre-operation backups 30 days · pinned never pruned.\nConsistency per adapter: stop | saveThenCopy | hot. Cancelling during SteamCMD leaves the files as they are and marks the instance \"needs verify\".",
      "originalText": "Backups: one folder for all instances (backupRoot, default C:\\GameWarden\\backups); copying it off the machine is up to you.\nDaily 04:00 (VM time) by default · keep the last 14 scheduled · pre-operation backups 30 days · pinned never pruned.\nConsistency per adapter: stop | saveThenCopy | hot. Cancelling during SteamCMD leaves the files as they are and marks the instance \"needs verify\".",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
